  "summary": "Deterministic privacy-minimized audit of an AI-agent execution trace for tool authorization, external-effect authority, loop signals, missing tool results, provenance gaps, receipt presence and bounded execution.",
  "request": {
    "mode": "OWNER_SHADOW_EXECUTOR_IMPLEMENTED_NOT_PUBLIC_LIVE",
